---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Show each monitor's last result, uptime and latency trend

Usage: rustman monitor status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Print JSON instead of a table

      --viz
          Open the trend view in the viz companion (rustman-viz); falls back to the text status without it

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
